1
00:00:00,438 --> 00:00:03,898
(Bernadette:)...for a man with a closet full
of magic tricks at his mother's house.

2
00:00:05,819 --> 00:00:09,109
(Howard:)First of all, they're not tricks.
They're illusions.

3
00:00:10,532 --> 00:00:13,202
(Howard:)Secondly, when we get married,
they're all going up in the attic...

4
00:00:13,368 --> 00:00:15,618
(Howard:)...so you can have that closet
for clothes.

5
00:00:16,288 --> 00:00:18,618
(Bernadette:)Why would I keep clothes
at your mother's house?

6
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,170
(Howard:)Well, don't think of it that way.

7
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:22,373
(Howard:)Once we move in, it'll be our house.

8
00:00:22,544 --> 00:00:23,924
(Bernadette:)Is she moving out?

9
00:00:24,087 --> 00:00:26,877
(Howard:)Why would she move out?
It's her house.

10
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:31,930
(Bernadette:)Hang on. You seriously think
I'm gonna live with your mother?

11
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:33,805
(Sheldon:)Howard, I think I can help here.

12
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:37,102
(Sheldon:)Yes, Bernadette,
that's exactly what he thinks.

13
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:40,147
(Howard:)Why not?
It's a great house, plenty of room.

14
00:00:40,312 --> 00:00:44,272
(Howard:)If we have kids, Mom's there to help.
When she tells "The Three Little Pigs"...

15
00:00:44,441 --> 00:00:46,731
(Howard:)...she actually has hair
on her chinny chin chin.

16
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:53,153
(Bernadette:)I'm not gonna live with your mother.
Not now, not ever.

17
00:00:53,325 --> 00:00:56,615
(Howard:)Wow, someone obviously has
some mommy issues.

18
00:00:58,997 --> 00:01:00,377
(Bernadette:)Raj, take me home.

